<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rFirst time here?\nRight this way!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! You got a Vs. Recorder!\nNice!\rWe upgrade Vs. Recorders for\nnewbies so they work at the Frontier.\rLemme borrow yours real quick.\rLet’s see... Slide this part open,\nand ticka-tacka-kachunk there!\rAll done!\nHere you go. Good as new. Better.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder got\nupgraded.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The other staff gon’ break down how\neach facility at the\fBattle Frontier work.\rI can cover the general stuff.\nYou got questions? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you want me to explain? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Frontier got five\nfacilities just for scrappin’.\rAt the Battle Tower, you gotta\nbeat seven Hustlers in a row.\rAt the Battle Hall, you keep\nrecords for each homie.\rAt the Battle Factory, you gotta\nwin streaks with rentals.\rThe Battle Castle make you manage\nCastle Points to move up.\rAnd the Battle Arcade is where\nrandom luck set off events.\rYou can hit any of these spots!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Scraps at all five Battle Frontier\nfacilities got special rules.\rFirst off, you can’t earn\nno Exp. Points.\rSo homies scrappin’ here\nain’t levelin’ up.\rIf you pick the Level 50 rule,\nhigher-level homies get\fknocked down to Lv. 50 for now.\rHomies under Lv. 50 roll in\nas is. No free levels.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Battle Points is usually called\nBP.\rBP only work in the\nBattle Frontier.\rYou get BP for hittin’ certain\ngoals at the different\fBattle Frontier facilities.\rYou can cash BP in for prizes at\nthe Exchange Service Corner.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Exchange Service Corner is\nthe two tents straight\fahead past here.\rThere, you can cash in your BP for\nall kinds of prizes.\rDefinitely check it out!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Performance Monitor show Hustler\ndata, like your last record and\fyour best record ever.\rThere’s one by the front\ndesk in every facility.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
