	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rWant me to explain how the\nBattle Tower work? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Tower is the buildin’ at\nthe back of the Battle Frontier.\rYou roll in with a team of\ndifferent homies and scrap till\fyou take a L.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rWant me to explain how the\nBattle Factory work? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Factory is in the top-\nright corner of the Battle Frontier.\rThere, you run a knockout\ntournament with rental homies.\rThe goal is to keep winnin’\nas long as you can.\rEvery time you win, you can swap\none of your homies for one of\fthe other guy’s homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rWant me to explain how the\nBattle Hall work? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Hall is in the top-left\ncorner of the Battle Frontier.\rHere, you roll in with one homie\nfor one-on-one scraps.\rThe goal is to keep your win\nstreak goin’ as long as you can.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rWant me to explain how the\nBattle Castle work? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Castle is in the bottom-\nleft corner of the Battle Frontier.\rHere, you get Castle Points, CP,\nand you gotta budget ’em.\rCP is for healin’ homies,\nrentin’ items or Berries, all that.\rThe goal is to keep a win streak\nalive while you manage your CP.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rWant me to explain how the\nBattle Arcade work? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Arcade is in the bottom-\nright corner of the Battle Frontier.\rHere, a game board spin\nbefore every scrap.\rDependin’ on what come up on the\nboard, somethin’ go down.\rSome events help the challenger,\nsome straight-up don’t.\rThe challenger might even get\nto skip the scrap entirely.\rThe goal is to keep a win streak\nalive as long as you can.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Frontier right up ahead!\nI explored places all over the\fworld, but nothin’ compare to the\fhype I feel right now!\rWhat kinda Hustlers I’mma see?\nWhat scraps I’mma get into?\rIt’s a whole new adventure for me!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The five facilities of the Battle\nFrontier is...\rTower.\rHall.\rCastle.\rFactory.\rAnd Arcade.\rHow you make a acronym outta\nthat? THCFA?\rMix up the letters, maybe?\nFATCH! CHAFT!\r...Nah! Nothin’ work!\nDid NOBODY think this through?!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Vs. Recorder hella handy!\rCheckin’ the Frontier Record\ntell you how much BP you got.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My dream is to scrap Palmer from\nthe Battle Tower.\rI wanna record it forever on\nmy Vs. Recorder.\rBut I left my Vs. Recorder\nat the crib... I’m devastated!</language>
	</row>
</body>
